@ContactAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5279

###Allowed origin: should return {"ok": true}
POST {{ContactAPI_HostAddress}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "firstName": "Fernando",
  "lastName": "Coveiro",
  "email": "nandocoveiro@example.com",
  "phone": "",
  "country": "United Kingdom",
  "message": "Hello World",
  "roles": ["Artist", "Coveiro"]
}

### Missing Required Fields test: should retur 400 with validation errors

POST {{ContactAPI_HostAddress}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName":"Rodrigo",
  "email": "no",
  "message":""
}

### Wrong Origin: should return 403
POST {{ContactAPI_HostAddress}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: https://bruv.com

{
  "firstName": "Fernando",
  "lastName": "Coveiro",
  "email": "nandocoveiro@example.com",
  "phone": "",
  "country": "United Kingdom",
  "message": "Hello World",
  "roles": ["Artist", "Coveiro"]
}

