### Method Not Allowed: expect 405
GET {{ContactAPI_HostAddress}}/api/contact
Origin: http://localhost:3000

### Wrong content type: expect 415
POST {{ContactAPI_HostAddress}}/api/contact
Content-Type: text/plain
Origin: http://localhost:3000

hello

